<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BWAY CORP STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BWAY CORP STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said on Monday it started coverage on the shares of BWAY Corp with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 1/4 to 26-3/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
